---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy & Terms · ChineseMusic.AI" description="Official Privacy Policy and Data Protection Statement for the 1st North American Chinese AI Music Contest." path="/en/privacy">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 space-y-8">
    
    <!-- Title Header -->
    <header class="text-center space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 bg-blue-950/40 text-blue-400 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold border border-blue-900/30">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
        <span>ChineseMusic.AI · Legal & Privacy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Privacy Policy & Data Protection
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs md:text-sm">
        Effective Date: August 28, 2026 · Last Updated: August 28, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Cards -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info text-blue-400 text-sm"></i>
          <span>1. Introduction & Commitment</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          The 1st North American Chinese AI Music Creation & Creativity Contest ("the Contest" or "we", co-organized by Zhejiang University Alumni Association of North Carolina - ZJUAA NC, and Chinese University Alumni Alliance of North Carolina - NACUAA NC, with non-profit & technology support from VI AI for Good Foundation) values and respects the privacy of all participants, creators, and visitors.
        </p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your personal information when you visit <a href="https://chinesemusic.ai/en" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">chinesemusic.ai</a> and submit entries through our official registration forms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-database text-blue-400 text-sm"></i>
          <span>2. Information We Collect</span>
        </h2>
        <p>When you register for the contest or communicate with the organizing committee, we may collect:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Participant Identity & Contacts</strong>: Full Name, English/Preferred Name, Email Address, WeChat ID, Phone Number, City, and Region Hub.</li>
          <li><strong>Work & Submission Details</strong>: Song/Work Title, Creation Mode (Pure Human / AI-Aided / AIGC), Submission Category (Poetry, Lyrics, Composition, Arranging, Vocal, A Cappella, Instrumental, MV), Public Media URL (Suno, Udio, YouTube, Cloud Drive, etc.), and Creative Concept description.</li>
          <li><strong>Special Category Declarations</strong>: Voluntary declarations for the Alma Mater Tribute Award (honoring Zhejiang University's 130th Anniversary).</li>
          <li><strong>Technical Logs</strong>: Standard anonymized server access logs (timestamps, IP address, device & browser headers) used strictly for rate-limiting, anti-spam, and cybersecurity defense.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye text-blue-400 text-sm"></i>
          <span>3. Purpose of Data Processing</span>
        </h2>
        <p>All information collected is processed solely for legitimate contest administration and public non-profit purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Judging & Award Evaluation</strong>: Verifying eligibility, coordinating jury scoring panels, and publishing official contest results.</li>
          <li><strong>Participant Communications</strong>: Sending preliminary selection notices, final stage invitations, awards ceremony passes, and essential contest updates.</li>
          <li><strong>Non-profit Showcase</strong>: Exhibiting nominated and winning creations on official contest channels, partner media, and community broadcasts with full author attribution.</li>
          <li><strong>Tax Compliance</strong>: Issuing 501(c)(3) charitable contribution tax receipts for contest sponsors.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-blue-400 text-sm"></i>
          <span>4. Data Protection & Non-Disclosure Commitment</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-950/30 border border-blue-900/40 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-blue-300 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check"></i>
            <span>No Commercial Sale or Rental Guarantee</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">
            <strong>We will never sell, rent, lease, or trade your personal information to third-party commercial entities, marketers, or advertisers.</strong> Contact credentials (emails, phone numbers, WeChat IDs) are restricted strictly to the organizing committee for contest operations and are never publicly disclosed without your explicit consent.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-copyright text-blue-400 text-sm"></i>
          <span>5. Intellectual Property & Copyright</span>
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Author Ownership</strong>: Intellectual property rights and copyrights of all submitted works <strong>remain exclusively with the original creators and authors</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Non-Exclusive Showcase License</strong>: Submitting an entry grants the organizing committee a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to broadcast, display, and promote the work in connection with the contest.</li>
          <li><strong>Originality Warranty</strong>: Entrants represent and warrant that their submissions do not infringe on third-party copyrights, trademarks, publicity rights, or trade secrets.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-user-gear text-blue-400 text-sm"></i>
          <span>6. Third-Party Services</span>
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Tally.so</strong>: Registration forms are processed via Tally.so (hosted in the European Union and strictly compliant with GDPR standards).</li>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>: Site content and APIs are delivered securely via Cloudflare global network with SSL/TLS encryption.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 pb-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-blue-400 text-sm"></i>
          <span>7. Your Rights & Contact Us</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal submission records at any time. For questions or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 space-y-1 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
          <div>📧 Privacy Inquiries: <a href="mailto:privacy@chinesemusic.ai" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">privacy@chinesemusic.ai</a> / <a href="mailto:info@chinesemusic.ai" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">info@chinesemusic.ai</a></div>
          <div>🏛️ Committee: ZJUAA NC & NACUAA NC AI Music Contest Task Force</div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>

    <div class="text-center pt-4">
      <a href="/en" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-800 font-bold text-xs inline-block transition-all">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left mr-1.5"></i> Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
